{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36701","headline":"湖州裴郎中赴阙後投简寄友生 · 罗隐","name":"湖州裴郎中赴阙後投简寄友生","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"锦帐郎官塞诏年，汀州曾驻木兰船。\n祢衡酒醒春瓶倒，柳恽诗成海月圆。\n歌蹙远山珠滴滴，漏催香烛泪涟涟。\n使君入拜吾徒在，宣室他时岂偶然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36701.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36701","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}